<string id="AllowChangeScriptUrlMitigation">Allow Change: Enable script url mitigation</string>
<string id="AllowChangeScriptUrlMitigation_Explain">
If you enable this setting, the end-user can change the "Enable script url mitigation" setting.

If you disable this setting, the user can not change the setting.  By default the user CAN change the setting.
</string>

<string id="AllowChangeSpellCheck">Allow Change: Enable spell-check in text boxes</string>
<string id="AllowChangeSpellCheck_Explain">
