If you disable this setting, the user can not change the setting.  By default the user CAN change the setting.
</string>

<string id="AllowChangeIETabHeader">Allow Change: Enable IE Tab request header</string>
<string id="AllowChangeIETabHeader_Explain">
If you enable this setting, the end-user can change the "Enable IE Tab request header" setting.

If you disable this setting, the user can not change the setting.  By default the user CAN change the setting.
